<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<Defs>

  <!-- A Trims section on Better Architect Menu's Decorate tab, where the seven
       shape buttons go by default while that mod is loaded; a player who
       unticks the mod setting has them on Floors. Without that mod they go to
       vanilla's Misc tab instead.

       MayRequire on the def itself: the game skips a top-level def whose
       MayRequire is unmet before it reads a field of it (LoadedModManager,
       1.6.4871 and 1.7.5011), so a player without Better Architect Menu never
       loads this def, never sees an empty tab, and the extension's class from
       that mod's assembly is never looked up. Better Architect Menu ships its
       own Toxic Waste section the same way.

       Nesting is that mod's feature: BetterArchitect.NestedCategoryExtension
       is a class in its assembly, and Ferny_Decorations its Decorate tab's
       defName. Check both when it updates; the harness case
       trims.buttons.tab.section reads the nesting back in a run with it
       loaded.

       The shape classes are named here as on Floors and Misc, and
       NeatEdges.Patch_TrimDesignators takes them off every tab but the one
       the setting picks, so with the box unticked this section holds no
       buildables and Better Architect Menu hides it. Order 790 puts it after
       that mod's Windows (850) and before its Outdoor (600); the tab lists its
       sections highest order first. -->

  <DesignationCategoryDef MayRequire="ferny.BetterArchitect">
    <defName>NE_Trims</defName>
    <label>trims</label>
    <description>Floor borders: visible trim along the edges of a floor, in every style and shape.</description>
    <order>790</order>
    <specialDesignatorClasses>
      <li>Designator_Cancel</li>
      <li>Designator_Deconstruct</li>
      <li>NeatEdges.Designator_TrimStraight</li>
      <li>NeatEdges.Designator_TrimCorner</li>
      <li>NeatEdges.Designator_TrimInsideCorner</li>
      <li>NeatEdges.Designator_TrimRunner</li>
      <li>NeatEdges.Designator_TrimEndCap</li>
      <li>NeatEdges.Designator_TrimFrame</li>
      <li>NeatEdges.Designator_TrimDiagonal</li>
    </specialDesignatorClasses>
    <modExtensions>
      <li Class="BetterArchitect.NestedCategoryExtension">
        <parentCategory>Ferny_Decorations</parentCategory>
      </li>
    </modExtensions>
  </DesignationCategoryDef>

</Defs>
